    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, im thinking about starting st johns wort to help with my mood cuz i've been feeling kinda down lately. i know im on the pill too so i was kinda worried about it clashing or anything? but i really want to try it, u think it's safe to just go for it?",
